{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"部分段落把行动的动力侧重写成保护珍爱之物、避免努力白费和证明自己，维持尊严的意味有时不够直接。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"行动线主要体现为当初选择离开、不愿重新忍受委屈，以及决定把眼下日子过好，缺少持续主动争取、维护尊严的行动过程。\",\n    \"怀念旧日亲近与归属、害怕孤独成为绝对主线，主要纠结于是否回去、能否重新获得陪伴，逐渐偏成了离开后的孤独与回归困境，而不是行动与怀念之间反复拉扯。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X 同时具备主动行动维护珍爱生活的动力，以及对旧日亲近、自在和归属的深切怀念，两者反复影响彼此：怀念推动行动，也使行动有所顾虑；行动带来力量，却又可能损伤所怀念的生活。Y 虽然保留了尊严与怀念两方面，但行动明显弱化，主要变成了如何面对离开后的孤独、是否回归的心理挣扎。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "db1d358e-0af1-453a-beb5-e6b6e7a45e22", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T075010064964Z", "elapsed_seconds": 15.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:50:25.486288+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2d1d727a434e897bb0f7425de546bba43665fb4700511d6e64b232f706448b8b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt